# 18. Evaluation & Hackathon Requirements

The final project must be prepared for the SIH evaluation requirements.

The official evaluation includes:

* AI/ML Implementation — 25
* Technical Implementation — 20
* Innovation & Creativity — 15
* Sustainability & Social Impact — 15
* User Experience — 10
* Problem Understanding — 10
* Presentation & Demo — 5

Total: 100 points.

The core macro-F1 on the held-out test set is particularly important, and reproducibility is a scored gate.

